203034f5c3993ad2e0bed3338d7a2d399d67157ff9237b10bb3fcacf","internal_url":"/posts/20260930-blogs_podcasts-prompt-engineering-fundamentals-for-amazon-quick-0-6ae68113c1/","observation_id":"obs_6ae68113c18a4270f54a3a967157a4599710478adc45c0961bd3021ae35ce6c4","published_at":"2026-09-29T16:27:57Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"它介绍了在 Amazon Quick 平台上，通过清晰、具体、具上下文且结合示例的提示方法，以及 CRISPE 等结构化框架，提升自然语言请求结果的准确性和可重复性。","title":"Prompt engineering fundamentals for Amazon Quick"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_f551453080ca0fd0f6b3b22af97f78591782e5819ca1f841eaa8920b250b7979","internal_url":"/posts/20260929-blogs_podcasts-the-effects-of-an-algorithmic-monoculture-depend-o-0-d08507c6dd/","observation_id":"obs_d08507c6dd8f3ff175b5a89f65155d9e981941998bb8fdabdd7b1704a4fb2395","published_at":"2026-09-29T04:00:00Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一篇关于“算法单一文化”现象的研究综述，探讨统一使用同一算法在不同情境下的潜在影响，指出其后果取决于细节，且常被提及的某些担忧并不一定成立。","title":"The effects of an “algorithmic monoculture” depend on the details"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_74ac7625f37b0766907e172cff1f63fb8968a4581c60f0b0d368baa861243236","internal_url":"/posts/20260930-arxiv-pdmd-projected-distribution-matching-distillation--0-a3ec0d34f6/","observation_id":"obs_a3ec0d34f67725e0144b7efdd803b91777f37233528b80249686bb9158b43074","published_at":"2026-09-28T17:59:52Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"PDMD 是一种针对视频扩散模型的知识蒸馏技术，通过在更新过程中过滤评论者（critic）引入的错误来提升训练稳定性，从而在减少函数评估次数的同时生成更高质量的视频样本。该方法仅需对现有框架做极小改动，无需额外的网络或数据。","title":"PDMD: Projected Distribution Matching Distillation for Video Diffusion Models"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_4301ea46ad3f5eac152d9df9ec5f88d37bc7312aa80c8d68f59a49902bfba807","internal_url":"/posts/20260926-blogs_podcasts-openrouter-from-seed-to-stripe-with-openrouters-al-0-bfe1ce9ba4/","observation_id":"obs_bfe1ce9ba4eb0335eda4f309e53f2d1c8370e4ac54d59254b0cfe195a5f6c4a7","published_at":"2026-09-25T23:14:41Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一段对话式播客，讲述 OpenRouter 从开源模型路由起家，成长为 AI 开发者常用的中立分发层，并涉及产品聚焦、模型市场与安全等议题。","title":"OpenRouter: from Seed to Stripe — with OpenRouter’s Alex Atallah & AMP’s Anjney Midha"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_097a80d23cf5b3fd9564e3701841d125ee394a1273f2a94368c7e68447eddd8b","internal_url":"/posts/20260929-arxiv-first-order-stationarity-of-reverse-diffusions-1-f33da46175/","observation_id":"obs_f33da46175678f5e74ad8f64447beada25e10861ecc6641d99c72b40072d8402","published_at":"2026-09-25T17:57:43Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"这篇论文把优化中的一阶平稳性概念迁移到扩散模型，给出基于随机微分方程的逆向扩散在强凸势条件下相对于 Fisher 散度的收缩性，并给出离散化后平均一阶平稳性界的理论结果。","title":"First-Order Stationarity of Reverse Diffusions"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_219361563ff24996d41759b53a76b18ef475b5f43d3ee2d64dcafeef5aba97bf","internal_url":"/posts/20260925-blogs_podcasts-speaker-labeled-transcription-with-whisperx-on-sag-0-779a1ba64a/","observation_id":"obs_779a1ba64af323a34a47ec8faadab92b3dda7836d54ea3b4e91007e1a0fc79b7","published_at":"2026-09-24T16:20:12Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"当前保存的是 RSS 或来源节选，不代表原文全文。请以原始来源为准。","title":"Speaker-labeled transcription with WhisperX on SageMaker AI"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_e3a48130be432146ca9e44c2d0df211176fff9824b16bd336f81840b89f2e711","internal_url":"/posts/20260924-arxiv-on-the-diffusibility-of-high-dimensional-latents-0-6b817f2bc4/","observation_id":"obs_6b817f2bc4e02aea4826074607cd0f2316da75c5f28a19039eb5302e96059ceb","published_at":"2026-09-23T17:59:56Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"- 该研究指出，对用于图像重建的预训练视觉编码器进行微调会压缩其表示的有效维度，进而影响扩散模型在高层特征空间中的生成效率。 - 为解决这一问题，文中建议在高层空间中放弃常规的速度预测，转而采用直接预测原始数据的 x₀ 参数化，使学习集中在信号流形上。","title":"On the Diffusibility of High-Dimensional Latents"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_5d1b9c6d741227b35d890745fc2bedd461ffeaeacf2450ffb09d0421b5680343","internal_url":"/posts/20260923-blogs_podcasts-ainews-claude-opus-55-the-new-default-model-for-ai-0-19163c30f0/","observation_id":"obs_19163c30f0a4c92555051d9a95875a42a5136c8cdeed8dd604a02883f528cc53","published_at":"2026-09-23T06:41:41Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"Anthropic 推出了新版 Claude Opus 5.5，宣称在多数任务上接近上代旗舰水平，同时 API 费用下调约 40%，并在写作和信息组织上有所提升。","title":"[AINews] Claude Opus 5.5, the new default model for AINews — and everybody cuts prices 40-50%"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_84aa093610752f16d5c8fca4804b6b78780d4ed57ede5ce9bdae9e49965058c4","internal_url":"/posts/20260923-arxiv-flash-dllm-io-aware-kv-caching-and-parallel-decodi-0-c45ca9ceec/","observation_id":"obs_c45ca9ceec83f5bcf4f447fffad2e57ed68001231a537be0cfc8500ed37b2dc9","published_at":"2026-09-22T17:59:57Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"该内容介绍了一种无需额外训练即可加速扩散语言模型推理的框架。它通过 I/O 感知的融合 KV‑缓存内核降低冗余内存搬运，并利用模型自身承担起草和验证的并行解码，实现更快的生成速度和更低的显存占用。","title":"Flash-dLLM: IO-Aware KV Caching and Parallel Decoding for Fast, Memory-Efficient Diffusion LLMs"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_5a72d9ab512c38d471ff4932e5d913753dbaab58410c503d1a1ef6048c1460b1","internal_url":"/posts/20260923-blogs_podcasts-claude-opus-55-is-now-available-on-aws-0-7322241f50/","observation_id":"obs_7322241f50811c86635013fca1c2dec777d6bc59ec939d3fe261730326e52f31","published_at":"2026-09-22T17:28:01Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一篇公告，介绍 Anthropic 在 Amazon Bedrock 与 Claude Platform 上线最新的 Opus 5.5 模型，强调其在 token 利用率、费用以及安全分类器方面的提升，并提供接入示例。","title":"Claude Opus 5.5 is now available on AWS"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_128b78e4eda9205c0b4af8abd102242f6cd9955caa570d3f2181066dbb74ac11","internal_url":"/posts/20260922-blogs_podcasts-how-bmw-group-detects-cost-anomalies-across-14000--0-e456ad33f9/","observation